{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2023-05", "window": 2, "start_date": 1683504000, "end_date": 1684195199, "month_true_total": 87, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:53:27 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "138354314", "author": {"steamid": "76561198013841965", "personaname": "Titan", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thunderchief666/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 11240, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2038, "last_played": 1740813558, "avatar": "8d66424ea520b5f30d21f20ae278cd93cc895d27"}, "language": "english", "review": "I was sort of curious about this game series in the past but never thought too much about it. Then, just a few weeks back, I saw a vid on youtube titled Tomahawking spiders. After seeing that, and finding the game on sale, I am HOOKED!!\nThe voice acting is so cringe, it comes full circle and becomes amazing, the graphics are great and the maps are so damn detailed!!\nThe game missions really impart a sense of scale as you're fighting the enemy and with 100+ missions along side multiplayer, you're not getting bored anytime soon!\n\n10/10 will happily kill spiders with cruise missiles again!", "timestamp_created": 1684183091, "timestamp_updated": 1684183091, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138338956", "author": {"steamid": "76561198275575852", "personaname": "𝚅𝚊𝚕𝚎𝚛𝚒𝚞𝚜", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bazelbooze/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 70, "playtime_forever": 3067, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2596, "last_played": 1684330888, "avatar": "41883f41c5d493a159dcfd17f0a097210eb6a018"}, "language": "english", "review": "Oh we are the valiant infantry. We are the alpha team with passion and camaraderie.\nHear us as we shout at the top of our lungs. Be calm, be bold and raise your guns.\n\nIt's only with our sacrifice, that mankind can still exist down here in paradise.\nTo defend our dearest Mother Earth, we're ready to give up our lives!\n\nHigh up in the air our comrades fight, dashing through the sky now like a million bolts of light.\nWe shall spread our wings wide and fly high. Soaring, gilding through the endless sky.\n\nNow pick up our weapons, off we go. Firing at the flying saucers, shooting down our foe.\nWe shall not allow these aliens, to rule we ♥♥♥♥ sapiens.", "timestamp_created": 1684160459, "timestamp_updated": 1684167260, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138311484", "author": {"steamid": "76561197996369247", "personaname": "Sickle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197996369247/", "num_games_owned": 503, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 859, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 811, "last_played": 1684779101, "avatar": "c6d6e8e19e70378d7ec83ebfeb10a88fd46473df"}, "language": "english", "review": "Just a good time, especially with friends", "timestamp_created": 1684098402, "timestamp_updated": 1684098402, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138